+    <th>Description</th>
+  </tr>
+  <tr>
+    <th><u>K</u>ey <u>c</u>odes</th>
+    <td>[xkb_keycodes]</td>
+    <td>`keycodes`</td>
+    <td>
+    A translation of the raw [key codes][keycode] from the keyboard into
