+Key types are used to compute:
+- the [shift level][]: see xkb_state::xkb_state_key_get_level().
+- the [consumed modifiers][]: see xkb_state::xkb_state_key_get_consumed_mods() and
+  xkb_state::xkb_state_key_get_consumed_mods2().
+
