+### XKB-034 – Malformed number literal {#XKB-034}
+
+<dl>
+  <dt>Since</dt><dd>1.0.0</dd>
+  <dt>Type</dt><dd>Error</dd>
+  <dt>Summary</dt><dd>Warn on malformed number literals</dd>
+</dl>
+
+xkbcommon can parse the following number literal formats:
+
