+| Layout     | Variant      | Symbols                       | Rules sets used |
+| ---------- | ------------ | ----------------------------- | --------------- |
+| `us`       |              | `pc+us`                       | #1              |
+| `us`       | `intl`       | `pc+us(intl)`                 | #1              |
+| `us,es`    |              | `pc+us+es:2`                  | #2, #3          |
+| `us,es,fr` | `intl,,bepo` | `pc+us(intl)+es:2+fr(bepo):3` | #2, #3, #4      |
 
