+## Data locations {#user-config-locations}
+
+libxkbcommon searches the following paths for XKB configuration files:
+1. `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/xkb/`, or `$HOME/.config/xkb/` if the `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`
