+ * The string is UTF-8 encoded and NULL-terminated.
+ *
+ * For example, given the following entry:
+ *
+ * ```
+ * <dead_tilde> <space> : "~" asciitilde # TILDE
+ * ```
+ *
+ * it will return `"~"`.
+ *
+ * The string is optional; if the entry does not specify a string,
