@@ -0,0 +1,163 @@
+/*
+ * Copyright © 2014 Ran Benita <ran234@gmail.com>
+ * Copyright © 2023 Pierre Le Marre <dev@wismill.eu>
+ *
+ * Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a
